    </edge>
    <data key="d0">ITT Star Luxury Watch Brand and Pricing Guidance Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qi9soN5bpU4</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless and AI/ML architecture for analyzing luxury watch image features and extracting embedded metadata into DynamoDB.</data>
    <data key="d3">AI ML, Serverless, Web Application</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
